``dxtbx.nexus.get_frame_counts``/``get_available_frame_count``: report how many leading frames of a live NXmx master are actually written to disk (via VDS source extent under SWMR, or file-close), resolving the DLS ``.``-self + external-link VDS layout. New ``dev.dxtbx.image_availability`` CLI live-monitors this, and ``dev.dxtbx.simulate_collection`` duplicates a master's structure and fills it via SWMR to test it.
